{
  "_about": "Opt-in content/v1 tool replies, using MCP CallToolResult member names. Content order is significant. Oversize uses expand_text to repeat the indicated part's text before serialization and decoding; it avoids storing a multi-MiB fixture. Every vector has a named decode-and-validate test in the wire crate.",
